    "No agent configuration was found for Claude Code, Codex CLI, or OpenCode. You can install a hook later from Settings once one is set up.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding step 3 body, shown when detection found no agents.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No agent configuration was found for Claude Code, Codex CLI, or OpenCode. You can install a hook later from Settings once one is set up."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Claude Code, Codex CLI veya OpenCode için yapılandırma bulunamadı. Birini kurduktan sonra kancayı Ayarlar'dan yükleyebilirsiniz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NotchFlow": {
      "comment": "About pane, build section title. The application name — normally left untranslated.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NotchFlow asks for nothing right now. Each permission is requested only when you turn on the feature that needs it, and only after NotchFlow explains what it is about to ask for.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding step 2 body.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow asks for nothing right now. Each permission is requested only when you turn on the feature that needs it, and only after NotchFlow explains what it is about to ask for."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow şu anda hiçbir şey istemiyor. Her izin, yalnızca ona gereksinim duyan özelliği açtığınızda ve yalnızca NotchFlow ne isteyeceğini açıkladıktan sonra istenir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NotchFlow asks macOS for each player separately, and only when you press the button.": {
      "comment": "Activities pane, Apple Events section caption.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow asks macOS for each player separately, and only when you press the button."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow her çalar için macOS'ten ayrı ayrı ve yalnızca düğmeye bastığınızda izin ister."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NotchFlow found configuration for the agents below. Turning one on here only records that you want it — nothing is written to any file. Installing the hook itself happens in Settings, where you see the exact snippet and approve the write.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding step 3 body, shown when detection found at least one agent.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow found configuration for the agents below. Turning one on here only records that you want it — nothing is written to any file. Installing the hook itself happens in Settings, where you see the exact snippet and approve the write."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow aşağıdaki araçlar için yapılandırma buldu. Burada birini açmak yalnızca onu istediğinizi kaydeder — hiçbir dosyaya yazılmaz. Kancanın kendisi, tam kod parçasını görüp yazmayı onayladığınız Ayarlar'dan kurulur."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NotchFlow has no Dock icon — it lives in the menu bar whether or not it starts at login.": {
      "comment": "General pane, Startup section caption.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow has no Dock icon — it lives in the menu bar whether or not it starts at login."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow'un Dock simgesi yoktur — oturum açılışında başlasa da başlamasa da menü çubuğunda yaşar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NotchFlow lives in the menu bar. Everything you just saw — and everything you skipped — can be changed at any time in Settings.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding step 4 body.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow lives in the menu bar. Everything you just saw — and everything you skipped — can be changed at any time in Settings."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow menü çubuğunda yaşar. Az önce gördükleriniz — ve atladıklarınız — istediğiniz zaman Ayarlar'dan değiştirilebilir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NotchFlow shows nothing for an agent until you enable it here.": {
      "comment": "AI Integrations pane, Agents section caption.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow shows nothing for an agent until you enable it here."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow, bir aracıyı burada etkinleştirene dek onun için hiçbir şey göstermez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "NotchFlow turns the area around your notch into a live activity surface: what is playing, running timers, screen and audio recording indicators, charging state, and the status of your AI coding agents.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding step 1 body.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow turns the area around your notch into a live activity surface: what is playing, running timers, screen and audio recording indicators, charging state, and the status of your AI coding agents."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "NotchFlow, çentiğinizin çevresini canlı bir etkinlik yüzeyine dönüştürür: çalanlar, çalışan zamanlayıcılar, ekran ve ses kaydı göstergeleri, şarj durumu ve yapay zekâ kodlama aracılarınızın durumu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
